  footer_rights:'© 2026 FundedBeyondBorders. All rights reserved.', footer_rules:'Rules', footer_contact:'Contact', footer_platform:'Platform',
  disclaimer_label:'Important note:',
  disclaimer_text:'FundedBeyondBorders is an educational trading-evaluation platform. All challenge accounts and "funded" accounts are fully simulated — no order is ever routed to a live financial market. We are not a broker, financial advisor, or investment service, and make no profit guarantees.',
  chat_title:'Live Support', chat_body:"Got a question? Leave us a message and we'll get back to you as fast as we can.", chat_placeholder:'Type your message...', chat_send:'Send',
  login_btn:'Log In', register_btn:'Sign Up',
  title_home:'FundedBeyondBorders | Prop Trading, Without Borders', title_rules:'Rules | FundedBeyondBorders', title_contact:'Contact | FundedBeyondBorders', title_platform:'Platform | FundedBeyondBorders', title_checkout:'Checkout | FundedBeyondBorders',

  home_eyebrow:'A prop trading platform, without borders',
  home_h1_1:'Prove your skill,', home_h1_2:"don't let borders hold you back.",
  home_lead:'FundedBeyondBorders is a trading evaluation platform: prove your skill in a fully simulated environment and unlock funded capital — with deposits and payouts entirely in crypto, no international bank account required.',
  home_mission:"Disputes between governments shouldn't be paid for by ordinary people. International sanctions have shut thousands of skilled traders out of global opportunity — simply because of the country they live in. We're here to stand with them, because talent doesn't recognize borders.",
  home_how_eyebrow:'Process', home_how_h2:'Three steps to funding',
  home_edge_eyebrow:'Why Us', home_edge_h2:"Advantages most competitors don't offer",
  home_edge1_title:'No Time Limit', home_edge1_desc:'Take as long as you need — no calendar pressure, no deadline stress. Prove your skill at your own pace.',
  home_edge2_title:'Account Growth Plan', home_edge2_desc:'Every profit withdrawal grows both your account size and your profit split — up to 100%.',
  home_edge3_title:'Fair Daily Rule', home_edge3_desc:"A 40% single-day profit cap rewards consistent trading, not one lucky day.",
  home_lb_eyebrow:'Achievements', home_lb_h2:'Traders Who Got Funded', home_lb_desc:'For privacy, no names or countries — just real, verified achievements.', home_ref_eyebrow:'Grow Together', home_ref_h2:'Invite Friends, Earn Cash', home_ref_desc:'Share your own referral link with friends — when they sign up and buy their first challenge, you get {{PCT}} of their purchase credited as cash directly to your wallet. No code needed.', home_ref_cta:'Sign Up to Get Your Link', newsletter_h2:'Stay in the Loop', newsletter_desc:'Get platform announcements, special discounts, and trading tips straight to your inbox.', newsletter_placeholder:'Enter your email', newsletter_btn:'Subscribe', newsletter_success:'You\'re subscribed!',
  loading:'Loading...',
  home_step1_title:'Choose your plan', home_step1_desc:'One-step, two-step, or three-step — pay with crypto and get instant access to the evaluation.',
  home_step2_title:'Prove your discipline', home_step2_desc:'Hit the profit target while respecting the risk rules, and complete the minimum trading days.',
  home_step3_title:'Get funded', home_step3_desc:'Once you clear every phase, you get a funded account and get paid directly in crypto.',
  home_plans_eyebrow:'Plans', home_plans_h2:'Pick your challenge model',
  home_plans_desc:'Maximum size per account is $500,000; maximum total active capital per trader is $750,000 (max 3 active accounts at once).',
  tab_1step:'One-Step', tab_2step:'Two-Step', tab_3step:'Three-Step', tab_instant:'Instant',
  nav_faq:'FAQ', nav_status:'Status', footer_privacy:'Privacy', rules_section_payout:'Profit Share & Payouts',
  title_faq:'FAQ | FundedBeyondBorders', faq_h1:'Frequently Asked Questions', faq1_q:'Is FundedBeyondBorders a broker?', faq1_a:'No. We are an educational trading-evaluation platform. All trading happens in a simulated environment — no order is ever sent to a live financial market.', faq2_q:'What happens if I fail a phase?', faq2_a:'The challenge account status becomes \'breached\' and you can no longer trade on it. You can purchase a new challenge and try again.', faq3_q:'What leverage do you offer?', faq3_a:'Leverage varies by market category (crypto is lower, forex is higher — you\'ll see the exact number next to each symbol on the platform itself). If your floating loss exceeds your free margin, your positions are automatically closed (a margin call) — full details are on the Rules page.', faq4_q:'How is funded-account profit paid out?', faq4_a:'When you request it, your profit share (per the rules) is instantly credited to your internal wallet in your dashboard. From there, you can submit a withdrawal request for real USDT (TRC20, ERC20, or BEP20) to your own address, which we send manually.', faq5_q:'Why do I need to submit KYC?', faq5_a:'Only before your first payout request — to make sure the payout actually reaches the person who opened the account. You can trade freely before that.', faq6_q:'Why do you only accept USDT?', faq6_a:'USDT has no price volatility, transaction fees (especially on TRC20 and BEP20) are very low, and it\'s accessible almost everywhere — this keeps deposits, withdrawals, and internal accounting simple and predictable.', faq7_q:'What\'s the difference between the free test account and a real challenge?', faq7_a:'The test account is only for feeling the spread and commission — it has no profit target or loss limit and can never become funded. To actually take part in the evaluation and reach funded capital, you need to buy one of the challenge plans. You can try it right now, with no signup required, from the \'Free Test Account\' button at the top of this page.', faq8_q:'How long does order verification take?', faq8_a:'Verifying the exact payment amount is always done manually by our team (for extra security), usually within a few hours. If it\'s taking longer, follow up via a support ticket.', faq9_q:'Can I have more than one account?', faq9_a:'Yes, up to 3 active accounts at once, with a combined total of up to $750,000. Full details are on the Rules page.', faq10_q:'What is Instant Funding?', faq10_a:'A higher-priced plan that funds your account immediately, with no evaluation phase at all — you can start trading right away with no phase to pass. (Note: the standard 14-day minimum before your first payout still applies here, same as every other plan.) In exchange, your profit share (50%) is lower than the regular plans and the loss limits are more conservative. It suits traders who want to start right away and are willing to pay more for it.', faq11_q:'What is two-factor authentication (2FA) and how do I enable it?', faq11_a:'An extra security layer — even if your password leaks, no one can log into your account without a code from an authenticator app (like Google Authenticator). From your dashboard\'s Account Security section, tap enable and scan the code into your app. We strongly recommend turning this on.', faq12_q:'What are Loyalty Rewards?', faq12_a:'Once your completed-order count hits certain milestones (e.g. your 3rd or 5th purchase), a one-time discount code is automatically added to your account — no action needed on your part. You\'ll find your codes in the Referrals section of your dashboard.', faq13_q:'How does the referral reward work?', faq13_a:'When a friend signs up with your referral link and buys their first challenge, 10% of that purchase amount is credited directly as cash to your wallet — no code or extra step needed. This reward only applies once, on each referred friend\'s first purchase.', faq14_q:'What are your commissions and spreads?', faq14_a:'Our round-turn commission on 1 standard forex lot is just $2.50, with tight spreads (around 0.1 pip on majors like EUR/USD) — among the lowest trading costs in the prop trading industry.',
