  status_title:'System Status | FundedBeyondBorders', status_h1:'Live Platform Status', status_recent_announcements:'Recent Announcements',
  priv1:'Privacy Policy | FundedBeyondBorders', priv2:'Privacy Policy', priv3:'This page explains what information we collect from you, why, and how we protect it.', priv4:'What we collect', priv5:'Email, password (encrypted), full name, country, and date of birth — at registration', priv6:'A government ID document (national ID/passport/license) — only if you request a payout', priv7:'Trading history, account balances, and the IP address of each trade — to enforce risk rules and detect fraud', priv8:'Support ticket messages', priv_news_collect:'Email address — only if you choose to sign up for the newsletter on the homepage', priv9:'How we protect it', priv10:'Your password is never stored in plain text — only a one-way, irreversible hash of it is stored', priv11:'Your ID document is stored with strong encryption (AES-256)', priv12:'Your login session is also stored hashed, not in plain form', priv13:'Only the site admin (with a separate security key) can access this information', priv14:'Why we collect it', priv15:'ID document: to make sure a payout actually reaches the person who opened the account (KYC)', priv16:'IP address: to detect abuse patterns like coordinated hedging between different accounts', priv17:'Date of birth and country: to cross-check against the ID document during KYC review', priv18:'Deleting your data', priv19:'You can request deletion of your login identity (credentials and ID document) via a support ticket. Trading and financial records are retained for dispute resolution and accounting purposes, even after account deletion.', priv20:'Third-party sharing', priv21:'We don\'t sell your information. We use Resend to send verification emails, and Binance/Twelve Data for live prices — these services only see the minimum data needed for their function (e.g. Resend only sees your email, never your password or ID document).', priv22:'Contact', priv23:'Questions about privacy? Reach out via the Contact page or the chat button.', priv_news_h3:'Newsletter', priv_news_p:'Newsletter signup is entirely optional and only happens with your consent. Every email we send includes an unsubscribe link — one click removes you instantly, no login required. We never share your email with any third party.',
